There's a mix of `defaultBoundary` and `testBoundary`. The mock `lenient().when(mapConfigurationService.getGameBoundary(TEST_GAME_ID)).thenReturn(defaultBoundary);` is likely what `isCoordinateInGameBoundary` uses.

